[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2015\u2015\u3068\u3044\u3046\u308F\u3051\u3067\u3002\n\u3044\u3088\u3044\u3088\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u304C\u8FEB\u3063\u3066\u304D\u305F\u308F\u3051\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, long story short... the Linde Festival is coming up soon..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30ED\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u3057\u305F\u3061\u306F\u524D\u56DE\u3068\u540C\u3058\u3067\u3001\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u4F5C\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306B\u914D\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just like last time, we\u0027ll be making lots of chocolate to hand out to everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30ED\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3048\u30FC\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yaay!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3001\u4ECA\u56DE\u3082\u6E96\u5099\u3067\u5FD9\u3057\u304F\u306A\u308B\u3068\u601D\u3046\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u4E8C\u4EBA\u3068\u3082\u899A\u609F\u3057\u3066\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you two should prepare yourselves for another busy preparation period!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30ED\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3001\u5927\u3052\u3055\u306B\u8A00\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u5B9F\u306F\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306B\u5FD9\u3057\u304F\u306A\u3089\u306A\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3063\u305F\u308A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Though I might be exaggerating a bit. It probably won\u0027t be that hectic this time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30ED\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3001\u306A\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, really?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u524D\u56DE\u306E\u7D4C\u9A13\u304C\u3042\u308B\u304B\u3089\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, we do have experience from last time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30AF\u30BB\u30EB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Iksel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u65B0\u4F5C\u30E1\u30CB\u30E5\u30FC\u3082\u524D\u3005\u304B\u3089\u8003\u3048\u3066\u305F\u3057\u3001\n\u76F4\u524D\u3067\u305D\u3053\u307E\u3067\u7126\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3063\u3066\u8A71\u3060\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I\u0027ve been thinking about the new menu items for a while now. We shouldn\u0027t need to rush at the last minute."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30AF\u30BB\u30EB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Iksel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, I see what you mean!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u308F\u3051\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u5F53\u65E5\u307E\u3067\u306F\u901A\u5E38\u55B6\u696D\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So yeah, we\u0027ll just keep running things as usual until the festival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30ED\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3001\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u5F53\u65E5\u306F\u5927\u5FD9\u3057\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3046\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u305D\u3053\u306F\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u6C17\u5408\u5165\u308C\u3066\u3044\u3053\u3046\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, the day of the festival will be super busy, so we\u0027ll need to bring our A-game then!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30ED\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\uFF5E\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3055\u3066\u3001\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u306E\u304A\u8A71\u3082\u7D42\u308F\u3063\u305F\u3057\u3001\n\u4ECA\u65E5\u306E\u3068\u3053\u308D\u306F\u89E3\u6563\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, that\u0027s all for the festival talk. Meeting adjourned!"
        }
